  body: "# Widow’s Benefits: the earlier death-date regime\n\n## Authored interpretation\n\nChapter 58 retains guidance
    on Widowed Mother’s Allowance and Widow’s Pension and points to Bereavement Benefit for deaths on or after 9
    April 2001.\n\n## Scope and exceptions\n\nThis is a historical regime boundary, not a complete present survivor-benefit
    test. Contribution, child-benefit, pregnancy, pension and later changes must be considered within the correct
    regime; BSP has its own later death-date boundary.\n\n## Inspected passages\n\n- [DMG 58001, PDF page 3](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a8050b9ed915d74e33f9b7e/dmgch58.pdf#page=3).\n\
    - [DMG 58016, PDF page 5](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a8050b9ed915d74e33f9b7e/dmgch58.pdf#page=5).\n\
    \n## Evidence and review status\n\nIndependent experimental interpretation of captured DWP guidance, not an
    official DWP document. Definitions and semantic associations are model-assisted proposals awaiting specialist
    review. No individual entitlement decision, medical conclusion, award calculation or executable rule is provided.\n\
    \nSource observation, listing-page update, printed revision, legal event and claimant-event dates are separate.
    Current legal applicability is unresolved. Page numbers are one-based PDF positions; machine extraction may
    damage reading order, characters and footnotes. No visual PDF or specialist acceptance is claimed.\n\n- `dmg-vol10-ch58`:
    PDF `6b9d46772e961138cd132e6441896d15c2c5f90f76d2577f72119654be82d3f8`; extracted pages `6d6ef555ba93c68a3a178d5cc02057ef4b54ad3dba4b14baa5c18491c307c94c`;
    acquired `2026-09-15T19:45:32.573488Z`.\n- `dmg-vol10-ch63`: PDF `7f894b8bac8a4056f9b89fff0df4cdb4231c1c2b187de78b5c64b6cc33636d88`;
    extracted pages `ed410bfb75f7f3ac15120a0dd10024bfb246faea02695229229deaed09d9033e`; acquired `2026-09-15T19:45:32.914779Z`.\n"
  resource: https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a8050b9ed915d74e33f9b7e/dmgch58.pdf#page=3
